<title>USA: RJR says Washington state AG claims dismissed.</title>
<headline>RJR says Washington state AG claims dismissed.</headline>
<dateline>WINSTON-SALEM, N.C. 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Washington State Court judge dismissed the state Attorney General's claims of special duty, unjust enrichment and consumer protection against the tobacco industry, RJR Nabisco Holdings Corp's RJ Reynolds Tobacco Co said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
